// Platform context — docs/schema-design.md §3.1 (B1.2).
// Prisma cannot express identity columns, check constraints, expression indexes, triggers or
// partitions: the migration SQL adds them by hand and test/integration/schema-catalog.int-spec.ts
// proves they exist. Every foreign key is declared here (the drift check would drop the others).

// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Enums (values: schema-design §4; values are only ever added)
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

